
============================================================
   Welcome to StorageOS Node
============================================================

To connect this node to controller(s):

  1. Get a 6-digit OTP from your admin dashboard
  2. Run: os-storage-enroll
  3. Enter the controller URL, node URL, and OTP
  4. Wait for admin approval
  5. Run: server-connect

To enroll with additional controllers:
  - Repeat steps 1-4 with os-storage-enroll

Available Commands:
  os-storage-enroll  - Enroll with a controller
  server-connect     - Start storage server and connect
  os-remove-node     - Remove enrollment from a controller

Config file: /etc/os/controllers.json

